agic abilities, each bending the laws of physics in thrilling and powerful ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Discover absurdly detailed secrets in every corner of your tower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Launch pad where you and your daredevil test pilot, Skully, can try out some truly questionable rocket designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc Large campaign with storyline, combat and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Hundreds of voice interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8d Incredible voice powers that can be used on everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 Infinite level generation mode for endless fun in the Fortress dungeon crawling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Team up with a friend in asymmetric co-op (Requires one player with a VR headset).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Chat with, juggle or torture Skully your skull assistant, imagination is the only limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1761747634\" width=616 height=43 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5f9998bfe292d33fd52cb39dd193e73c.poster.avif?t=1761747634\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5f9998bfe292d33fd52cb39dd193e73c.webm?t=1761747634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5f9998bfe292d33fd52cb39dd193e73c.mp4?t=1761747634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET SKULLY,